message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "LIBRA-Eval & META-RAG: Metadata-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Library Discovery"
abstract: >-
  A metadata-aware RAG system for library discovery (META-RAG) and a two-sided
  benchmark (LIBRA-Eval) with 1,200 discovery questions and 600 cataloging
  records. Shows retrieval quality is bounded by metadata quality: metadata-aware
  retrieval improves topical discovery nDCG@10 from 0.415 to 0.633 (p<0.001) on
  227 books / 300 questions.
type: software
